5,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must learn from past mistakes. I will examine the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts and the record of cross-unit standardization efforts.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m still deciding. I worry about where the money actually comes from. I’ll look into the capital budget and software allowance.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, I bet the network coverage at customer plants is a total mystery! I’ll check that, plus in-house developer availability.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will examine the time lost to copying existing records and the misrouted deliveries in the incident logs.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the staffing of the coordination group and the handling of vendor queries.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,A pattern emerges when we look back. I wonder if the narrow tools that survived tell us something about what actually works on the floor.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I just want to make sure the recurring costs are covered. The capital line is frozen, so I hope the software allowance is enough.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, if the capital line is frozen, maybe we can’t build anything new? I’m curious if our developers are even free to help!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Sakura, developer availability is a constraint, not a solution. I am focused on the daily operational losses we ignore.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, operational losses are real, but they are absorbed by people. I am checking who is actually doing the work.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, you are right. The people absorb the strain. I hope the past reviews show us which tools truly lighten that burden.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Servas, I agree. If the capital line is frozen, we must rely on the software allowance. I hope it covers the recurring costs without surprises.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Ryuji, that sounds serious! I’m worried our tech might fail at customer sites. I’ll check the network coverage to see if it’s really that bad!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Sakura, I am not dismissing the risk. I am asking why we fund tools that fail silently. The logs show the cost of inaction.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Sakura, network coverage is a prerequisite, not a feature. If the signal drops, the app is useless. I am checking who is left to fix the rotas when it does.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, your caution is wise. A tool that cannot reach the field is merely a promise. Let us see what the past reveals about such fragile foundations.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I just want to be sure the recurring costs are covered. I hope the software allowance is enough.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Asuka, that’s scary! If the signal drops, the app is useless. I’m glad I’m checking the network coverage to see if it’s really that bad!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, if the rotas break, the losses I track become invisible. I need to see if the daily copying time is the root cause of that strain.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, the copying is a symptom. The root is that no one is assigned to maintain the system. I am checking the staffing to confirm this gap.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
