74,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, distributing load is not the same as assigning responsibility. Without a named owner, the Hub will rot like the others. I cannot support it without that guarantee.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, your caution is vital. Yet the past shows narrow tools survive. A simple catalog with clear procedures is less demanding than a complex app. It endures without heroic effort.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
