77,3,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Asuka, I know it’s scary! But if we don’t fix the data, the rotas keep breaking. I think the Hub is the best bet!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, the data shows the cost of inaction. The Hub addresses the root cause. I cannot support a solution that ignores the daily losses.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
